title: the diff view
pid: b655e5f1-b83d-4f7c-b665-cfe2a23701c1
body: |2-
  Tried: the diff view, which lists every change since the last commit.
  Expected: the notes he had changed and not committed, or at least a count of them.
  Happened: "nothing changed since the last commits". The diff view compares only the skgrepos I own; a foreign one is read the same on both sides, so it can never show a change.
